<title>POLAND: NBP sells PLN 530 mln 91-day bills,avg yield 22.24.</title>
<headline>NBP sells PLN 530 mln 91-day bills,avg yield 22.24.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 530 million zlotys worth of its 91-day bills, the amount investors bid for, at its 600 million zloty tender today, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the paper rose 0.04 point to 22.24 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
